{
  "slug": "search-console-mcp",
  "name": "Search Console Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Google Search Console to Claude Code. Query rankings, inspect URLs, audit indexing, and find content opportunities through natural language. Built for SEO workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `cannibalization-check` (Detect keyword cannibalization — queries where multiple pages compete for the same rankings), `content-opportunities` (Find quick-win content optimization targets — high impressions, low CTR, position 11-20), `indexing-audit` (Audit indexing status across top pages), `seo-weekly-report` (Generate a complete weekly SEO performance report for a site)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mcp-search-console`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install search-console-mcp@claude-community` from `AminForou/mcp-gsc`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
